synopsis: "Syntactic \"inlining\" for functor applications"
description: """

This preprocessor syntactically "inlines" functor applications. It is designed for use in
`Ox`, which heavily uses functors for abstracting over similar shapes in modules like
`Ptr` and `Ptr.Ext`, but must guarantee that everything --- including functions defined
deep within the stack of functor arguments --- is thoroughly inlined.
"""
